        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDH101, Solid Brass Short Shutter Door Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/4\" long window shutter holder is easy to install and made from quality solid brass for longevity. The Solid Brass Short Shutter Door Holder includes all necessary mounting hardware. Deltana is an architectural door and window hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDH101-Specifications.gif?v=1704354779\" width=\"403\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDH101 Solid Brass Short Shutter Door Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-long-shutter-door-holder-deltana-sdh103\"><b>Long Shutter Door Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDH101 Short Shutter Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
